    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Martes foina, more commonly known as stone martens or beech martens, are found across Europe, and Central Asia. They are weasel-like carnivores that are more generally found in deciduous forests or on rocky hillsides. [Source: Getty AAT]</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
